  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Rotates the object/prim around <b>axis</b> at a rate of `**spinrate** * [llVecMag](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlVecMag)(**axis**)` in radians per second with strength <b>gain</b>.</p>
</p>
